000D60r 1  60                   rts
000D61r 1               
000D61r 1               ; send the squares that differ from what the terminal shows.  A run of the
000D61r 1               ; same square is sent once with the repeat count (18 n, then 0B tile).
000D61r 1               
000D61r 1               ; write the squares that differ from what the screen shows
000D61r 1               present:
